---
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="intro">
  <p>I build software with AI coding agents and keep notes on what the work teaches me.
  When a lesson holds up long enough to trust, it becomes an essay here. Each one is
  written from logged decisions on real projects, so you can put it to use in an
  afternoon.</p>
</section>

<h1 class="rule-head">Essays</h1>
<ol class="sheet-index">
  {% for e in collections.essay | reverse %}
  <li>
    <div class="index-line">
      <a href="{{ e.url }}">{{ e.data.title }}</a>
      <span class="index-date">{{ e.date | isoDate }}</span>
    </div>
    <p>{{ e.data.description }}</p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>
